Project 1: NOMI — AI-Powered Mobile Banking Platform
Canada's first AI-driven personal finance suite, embedded in the RBC Mobile app and serving 1.5M+ active users across iOS and Android. NOMI evolved from a simple insights engine into a full financial intelligence platform through four major feature releases between 2017 and 2021 — each requiring significant greenfield engineering across every layer of the stack.
