Project 2: Aiden — AI-Powered Electronic Trading Platform
A first-of-its-kind in the financial industry — an electronic trading platform built entirely on deep reinforcement learning, replacing static rule-based algorithms. Developed jointly by RBC Capital Markets and Borealis AI over five years of R&D (2016–2020), then launched globally in October 2020. Aiden executes buy/sell orders in US and Canadian equities in real time, making 32M+ calculations per order and adapting to live market conditions without any re-coding.
